{"task_id": "HumanEval/44", "solution": "def change_base(x: int, base: int):\n    \"\"\"Change numerical base of input number x to base.\n    Returns string representation after the conversion.\n    \"\"\"\n    if x == 0:\n        return \"0\"\n\n    res = []\n    while x > 0:\n        remainder = x % base\n        res.append(str(remainder))\n        x //= base\n    \n    return \"\".join(res[::-1])"}
